ploads/2026/11/179535076937494831_18134566436b02e0f1b5be2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：YouTube@金馬影展TGHFF）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179535077140721139_15246468996b02e0f3d36de.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"金馬獎 江𤒹生 （圖片來源：YouTube@金馬影展TGHFF）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179535077140721139_15246468996b02e0f3d36de.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：YouTube@金馬影展TGHFF）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179535077303721501_15890096646b02e0f585e77.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"金馬獎 江𤒹生 （圖片來源：YouTube@金馬影展TGHFF）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179535077303721501_15890096646b02e0f585e77.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：YouTube@金馬影展TGHFF）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179535077461085536_15196821776b02e0f76a390.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"金馬獎 江𤒹生 （圖片來源：《我們不是什麼》）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179535077461085536_15196821776b02e0f76a390.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：《我們不是什麼》）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T13:03:52.476382+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1436,"images":9,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T12:33:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T12:57:29.550558+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T12:57:29.550558+00:00","content_hash":"7de339269adb6cb881c75a2dff15bad125ca7149f2647b29b4217104014be25e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}